==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

